---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const datasetSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "needle-bench AI Coding Agent Benchmark",
  "description": "Open benchmark for AI coding agents. Real bugs as frozen Docker snapshots, deterministic scoring across native CLI, kernel (OpenRouter) and CPU (native driver) arms.",
  "url": "https://needle-bench.cc/",
  "license": "https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT",
  "keywords": ["AI coding benchmark", "LLM evaluation", "agent benchmark", "debugging benchmark", "Docker bugs", "Claude", "GPT", "Gemini", "DeepSeek"],
  "creator": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "os-tack",
    "url": "https://github.com/os-tack"
  },
  "distribution": {
    "@type": "DataDownload",
    "encodingFormat": "application/json",
    "contentUrl": "https://needle-bench.cc/cells-v760.json"
  }
};
---

<Base
  title="needle-bench — AI coding agent leaderboard on real Docker bugs"
  description="Open benchmark for AI coding agents. v7.6.0: 8 frontier models × 38 real-bug Docker benchmarks, native vendor CLI vs ostk kernel. Resolved-gated, per-bucket cost. Deterministic scoring."
  jsonLd={datasetSchema}
>
  <main>
    <h1 class="visually-hidden">needle-bench AI Coding Agent Leaderboard</h1>
    <div class="experiment-info">
      <p><strong>v7.6.0 &mdash; native vendor CLI vs ostk kernel.</strong> 8 frontier models &times; 38 benchmarks, single-shot (samples=1), captured 2026-06-15. Cost/token &Delta; are resolved-gated (cells both arms solved) and per-bucket priced. Anthropic carries a full cache split; other harnesses report a usable total (basis noted per model) &mdash; see the per-cell matrix below.</p>
      <p class="muted">Cost &Delta; / Token &Delta; = kernel vs native (<span style="color:#3fb950">negative = kernel cheaper/lighter</span>). Click headers to sort, or jump to the <a href="#matrix-wrap">per-cell matrix &darr;</a></p>
    </div>

    <div class="lb-container" id="lb-container">
      <table id="lb">
        <thead>
          <tr id="lb-group-row">
            <th colspan="2"></th>
            <th colspan="1" class="group-header group-native">Native</th>
            <th colspan="1" class="group-header group-cpu">Kernel</th>
            <th colspan="2" class="group-header group-native">Native (vendor CLI)</th>
            <th colspan="2" class="group-header group-cpu">Kernel (ostk)</th>
            <th colspan="2"></th>
          </tr>
          <tr id="lb-head">
            <th class="col-model" data-key="model">Model</th>
            <th data-key="type" title="B = true kernel (native CpuDriver); B* = generic OpenRouter kernel">Type</th>
            <th class="col-solve arm-native" data-key="native_solved" title="resolved of 38 published benchmarks">Solve</th>
            <th class="col-solve arm-cpu" data-key="kernel_solved" title="resolved of 38 published benchmarks">Solve</th>
            <th class="col-metric arm-native" data-key="native_cost">Cost</th>
            <th class="col-metric arm-native" data-key="native_tok" title="billed tokens; fresh / cache-read / cache-create breakdown below">Tokens</th>
            <th class="col-metric arm-cpu" data-key="kernel_cost">Cost</th>
            <th class="col-metric arm-cpu" data-key="kernel_tok" title="billed tokens; fresh / cache-read / cache-create breakdown below">Tokens</th>
            <th class="col-metric" data-key="cost_delta" title="kernel vs native cost over both-solved cells (Anthropic only)">Cost &Delta;</th>
            <th class="col-metric" data-key="tok_delta" title="kernel vs native billed tokens over both-solved cells (Anthropic only)">Tok &Delta;</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody id="lb-body">
          <tr><td colspan="10" class="empty">Loading...</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <p class="bstar-note muted"><sup class="bstar">*</sup> <strong>B*</strong>: kernel solve sourced from the generic OpenRouter kernel (no hand-written native driver for this provider) &mdash; distinct from true <strong>B</strong> (kernel-cpu, native driver).</p>

    <div class="totals" id="totals"></div>

    <section class="matrix-section">
      <div class="matrix-head">
        <h2>Per-cell results</h2>
        <p class="muted">Every model &times; benchmark. Each cell splits <b class="lg-n">native</b>&#8201;&#9474;&#8201;<b class="lg-k">kernel</b>, colored by outcome. Benchmarks run hardest &rarr; easiest left to right. Tap any cell for the full token &amp; cost breakdown.</p>
        <div class="hm-legend">
          <span><i class="sw pass"></i>solved</span>
          <span><i class="sw fail"></i>failed</span>
          <span><i class="sw deadline"></i>timeout</span>
          <span><i class="sw infra"></i>harness</span>
          <span><i class="sw missing"></i>n/a</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="matrix-wrap" id="matrix-wrap"><div class="empty">Loading matrix&hellip;</div></div>
      <div class="matrix-mobile" id="matrix-mobile"></div>
      <div class="cell-detail" id="cell-detail" hidden></div>
    </section>

    <section class="results-summary">
      <h2>Results</h2>

      <h3>Key findings (v7.6.0)</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>The kernel's cache win is Anthropic-specific.</strong> With the cache-sliver active, opus ties native on solve at &minus;2.5% cost / &minus;31% tokens; sonnet is &minus;42% cost / &minus;66% tokens. Explicit <code>cache_control</code> is Anthropic-only &mdash; that's the lever.</li>
        <li><strong>Outside Anthropic, the kernel costs more</strong> &mdash; it routes through clients that forfeit the provider's automatic prompt caching the native CLI gets for free. Per both-solved cell: gemini +116%, gpt-5.5 +276%. Honest inverse of the opus story.</li>
        <li><strong>Harness ceilings, not just models.</strong> devstral's native (Mistral Vibe) caps at 20 turns and solved 6/38; through the kernel it reached 32/38. Real, but it's the native harness's limit being removed, not raw capability.</li>
        <li><strong>Solve parity holds for the strong models</strong> (opus, gpt, gemini, deepseek within 1&ndash;3 cells across arms); the kernel's value is provider- and harness-specific, not universal.</li>
        <li><strong>A genuine difficulty ceiling.</strong> Only 1 of 37 benches (<code>postgres-migration-schema-drift</code>, 12%) is a true wall and 9 discriminate; 27 are floor. The matrix above shows it &mdash; benches ordered hardest&rarr;easiest.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Methodology</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>38 Docker benchmarks with real bugs (<code>test.sh</code> exits 0 = fixed). 2 legacy pre-kernel tests retired.</li>
        <li><strong>Native</strong>: vendor CLI with its own key. <strong>Kernel (B)</strong>: ostk with native CpuDriver. <strong>B*</strong>: ostk via generic OpenRouter (no native driver for that provider).</li>
        <li>Cost summed per token bucket (fresh 1&times;, cache-read 0.1&times;, cache-create 1.25&times;/2&times;) on a rate card validated to &lt;0.5% of real Anthropic billing.</li>
        <li>Efficiency &Delta; computed only over cells <em>both</em> arms solved; split-resolve, both-fail, and zero-work infra cells excluded.</li>
        <li>Cost/token &Delta; shown only for Anthropic &mdash; gemini-cli / codex / opencode native arms don't report cost (solve-rate only).</li>
        <li>ostk under-reports its own cost ~13%; figures here use the corrected per-bucket recompute, not ostk's self-estimate.</li>
      </ul>
      <p style="margin-top:0.8rem;"><a href="/v760.html">&rarr; Full verified results, per-cell tables, and caveats (v7.6.0)</a></p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>

<style is:global>
  main { max-width: none; padding: 1rem 1.5rem 2rem; }

  .visually-hidden {
    position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px;
    padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden;
    clip: rect(0,0,0,0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0;
  }

  .experiment-info { font-size: 0.85rem; max-width: 800px; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  .experiment-info p { margin: 0 0 0.25rem; }

  .lb-container {
    overflow-x: auto; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--bg); -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
  }

  #lb { border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 0; min-width: 100%; font-size: 0.72rem; }

  /* Group headers */
  .group-header {
    text-align: center !important; font-size: 0.6rem; padding: 0.3rem 0.4rem !important;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border) !important; letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }
  .group-native { background: rgba(248,81,73,0.08); color: #f85149; }
  .group-kernel { background: rgba(210,153,34,0.08); color: #d29922; }
  .group-cpu { background: rgba(63,185,80,0.08); color: #3fb950; }

  /* B* marker: generic OpenRouter kernel (no native driver) */
  .bstar { color: #d29922; font-weight: 700; cursor: help; }
  .bstar-note { font-size: 0.7rem; margin: 0.4rem 0 0; }

  #lb th {
    padding: 0.4rem 0.4rem; font-size: 0.6rem; letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase; background: var(--surface); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border);
    white-space: nowrap; cursor: pointer; user-select: none; text-align: right;
  }
  #lb th.sorted { color: #d4a054; }
  #lb th:first-child { text-align: left; }
  #lb th[title] { cursor: help; }
  #lb th.last { border-right: 2px solid rgba(139,148,158,0.2); }

  /* Sticky model column */
  .col-model, #lb td:first-child {
    position: sticky; left: 0; z-index: 2; background: var(--surface);
    min-width: 150px; width: 150px;
  }
  #lb th:first-child { z-index: 3; }

  .col-price { min-width: 45px; }
  .col-solve { min-width: 52px; text-align: center !important; }
  .col-metric { min-width: 50px; }
  .col-delta { min-width: 45px; text-align: center !important; }

  /* Arm column tinting */
  .arm-native { background: rgba(248,81,73,0.03) !important; }
  .arm-kernel { background: rgba(210,153,34,0.03) !important; }
  .arm-cpu { background: rgba(63,185,80,0.03) !important; }
  td.arm-native { background: rgba(248,81,73,0.03) !important; }
  td.arm-kernel { background: rgba(210,153,34,0.03) !important; }
  td.arm-cpu { background: rgba(63,185,80,0.03) !important; }
  td.last { border-right: 2px solid rgba(139,148,158,0.15); }

  #lb td {
    padding: 0.3rem 0.4rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.68rem; white-space: nowrap; text-align: right;
  }
  #lb tr:nth-child(even) td { background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.015); }
  #lb tr:hover td { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); }
  #lb tr:hover td:first-child { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface) 94%, white); }

  .model-name { font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--text); }

  .solve-pct { font-weight: 700; }
  .pct-100 { color: #3fb950; }
  .pct-90  { color: #3fb950; }
  .pct-70  { color: #d29922; }
  .pct-50  { color: #db6d28; }
  .pct-30  { color: #f85149; }
  .pct-0   { color: #484f58; }
  .pct-na  { color: #30363d; font-weight: 400; }

  .delta-pos { color: #3fb950; font-weight: 600; }
  .delta-neg { color: #f85149; font-weight: 600; }
  .delta-zero { color: #484f58; }

  .dim { color: #484f58; }

  .totals { font-size: 0.78rem; margin: 0.5rem 0; color: var(--text-muted); font-family: var(--mono); }

  .arm-comparison {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr)); gap: 0.75rem;
    margin: 1rem 0; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
  .arm-card {
    background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem;
  }
  .arm-card h4 { margin: 0 0 0.4rem; font-size: 0.7rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .arm-card .big { font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .arm-card .detail { font-size: 0.68rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.5; }

  .results-summary { max-width: 800px; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1.5rem; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  .results-summary h2 { margin-top: 0; }
  .results-summary h3 { margin: 1rem 0 0.4rem; font-size: 0.95rem; }
  .results-summary ul { padding-left: 1.5rem; margin: 0.4rem 0; }
  .results-summary li { margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .arm-comparison { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    main { padding: 0.5rem; }
    .col-model { width: 100px; min-width: 100px; }
  }

  /* ============ PER-CELL MATRIX (reinvented heatmap) ============ */
  .matrix-section { margin: 2.2rem 0 1rem; }
  .matrix-head h2 { margin: 0 0 0.3rem; font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .matrix-head .muted { font-size: 0.78rem; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 0 0.5rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  .lg-n { color: #f0883e; } .lg-k { color: #3fb950; }
  .hm-legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.9rem; font-size: 0.68rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 0.7rem; }
  .hm-legend span { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.3rem; }
  .sw { width: 11px; height: 11px; border-radius: 2px; display: inline-block; }
  .sw.pass { background: rgba(63,185,80,0.65); }
  .sw.fail { background: rgba(248,81,73,0.6); }
  .sw.deadline { background: rgba(210,153,34,0.55); }
  .sw.infra { background: rgba(110,118,129,0.5); }
  .sw.missing { background: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, transparent, transparent 2px, rgba(139,148,158,0.4) 2px, rgba(139,148,158,0.4) 3px); border: 1px solid var(--border); }

  /* ---- desktop matrix ---- */
  .matrix-wrap { overflow-x: auto; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 6px; background: var(--bg); -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; }
  .hm-table { border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 0; }
  .hm-table th, .hm-table td { padding: 0; }
  .hm-table .corner { position: sticky; left: 0; z-index: 4; background: var(--surface); }
  .hm-table thead .tier-band { font-size: 0.56rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-align: center; padding: 0.2rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); font-weight: 700; }
  .tier-band.ceiling { background: rgba(248,81,73,0.13); color: #f85149; }
  .tier-band.discriminating { background: rgba(210,153,34,0.12); color: #d29922; }
  .tier-band.floor { background: rgba(63,185,80,0.10); color: #3fb950; }
  .hm-table .bench-h { vertical-align: bottom; height: 116px; background: var(--surface); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border); }
  .hm-table .bench-h > div { writing-mode: vertical-rl; transform: rotate(180deg); white-space: nowrap; font-size: 0.6rem; color: var(--text-muted); padding: 0.3rem 0; margin: 0 auto; max-height: 110px; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; cursor: help; }
  .hm-table .bench-h .bh-pct { font-size: 0.52rem; color: #6e7681; }
  .hm-table .model-h { position: sticky; left: 0; z-index: 3; background: var(--surface); text-align: left; padding: 0 0.55rem; white-space: nowrap; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); border-right: 2px solid var(--border); }
  .hm-table tbody tr:nth-child(even) .model-h { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface) 97%, white); }
  .hm-table .model-h .mn { font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--text); }
  .hm-table .model-h .mt { font-size: 0.56rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-left: 0.25rem; }
  .hm-table .model-h .ms { display: block; font-size: 0.56rem; color: #6e7681; font-family: var(--mono); }
  .hm-cell { width: 24px; height: 24px; text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(139,148,158,0.08); border-right: 1px solid rgba(139,148,158,0.06); }
  .hm-split { display: flex; width: 18px; height: 18px; margin: 0 auto; border-radius: 3px; overflow: hidden; cursor: pointer; outline: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.25); }
  .hm-split:hover { outline: 1.5px solid #d4a054; }
  .hm-split > i { flex: 1; height: 100%; }
  .hm-split > i + i { border-left: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }
  .st-pass { background: rgba(63,185,80,0.65); }
  .st-fail { background: rgba(248,81,73,0.6); }
  .st-deadline { background: rgba(210,153,34,0.55); }
  .st-infra { background: rgba(110,118,129,0.5); }
  .st-missing { background: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, transparent, transparent 2px, rgba(139,148,158,0.35) 2px, rgba(139,148,158,0.35) 3px); }

  /* ---- mobile accordion ---- */
  .matrix-mobile { display: none; }
  .mm-model { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; overflow: hidden; background: var(--surface); }
  .mm-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.6rem 0.7rem; cursor: pointer; }
  .mm-head .mn { font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.82rem; flex: 1; }
  .mm-head .mt { font-size: 0.6rem; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .mm-head .mm-solve { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.68rem; }
  .mm-head .car { transition: transform 0.15s; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .mm-model.open .car { transform: rotate(90deg); }
  .mm-body { display: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .mm-model.open .mm-body { display: block; }
  .mm-tier { font-size: 0.56rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; padding: 0.25rem 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; background: var(--bg); }
  .mm-tier.ceiling { color: #f85149; } .mm-tier.discriminating { color: #d29922; } .mm-tier.floor { color: #3fb950; }
  .mm-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.4rem 0.7rem; border-top: 1px solid rgba(139,148,158,0.08); font-size: 0.72rem; cursor: pointer; }
  .mm-row .bn { flex: 1; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
  .mm-row .hm-split { cursor: pointer; }
  .mm-row .arms { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.62rem; color: var(--text-muted); min-width: 88px; text-align: right; }

  /* ---- shared detail panel ---- */
  .cell-detail { position: sticky; bottom: 0; margin-top: 0.6rem; background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid #d4a054; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0.7rem 0.9rem; font-size: 0.74rem; box-shadow: 0 -4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }
  .cell-detail .cd-close { float: right; cursor: pointer; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1; }
  .cell-detail h4 { margin: 0 0 0.1rem; font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .cell-detail .cd-sub { font-size: 0.64rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .cd-arms { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0.6rem; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.66rem; }
  .cd-arm { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 5px; padding: 0.45rem 0.55rem; }
  .cd-arm.native { border-left: 3px solid #f0883e; }
  .cd-arm.kernel { border-left: 3px solid #3fb950; }
  .cd-arm .cd-h { font-size: 0.62rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
  .cd-arm .cd-st { font-weight: 700; }
  .cd-arm .cd-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .cd-arm .cd-row b { color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }
  .cd-delta { margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.66rem; font-family: var(--mono); color: var(--text-muted); }
  .cd-delta b.neg { color: #3fb950; } .cd-delta b.pos { color: #f85149; }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .matrix-wrap { display: none; }
    .matrix-mobile { display: block; }
    .cd-arms { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>

<script>
  interface ArmAgg { solved: number; total: number; cost: number; tokens: number; tools: number; turns: number; wall: number; }
  interface ModelData {
    model: string; model_normalized: string; benchmarks: number;
    native: ArmAgg; kernel: ArmAgg; cpu: ArmAgg;
    price_per_m_input?: number; price_per_m_output?: number;
    native_cli?: string; cpu_driver_status?: string;
    // B vs B* labeling (frontier-2026): "native_driver" → true B (kernel-cpu),
    // "generic_kernel" → B* (kernel via OpenRouter, no native driver).
    kernel_arm_type?: string;
  }

  function fmtN(n: number): string { return n >= 1e6 ? (n/1e6).toFixed(1)+'M' : n >= 1e3 ? (n/1e3).toFixed(0)+'k' : String(n); }
  function fmtT(s: number): string { return s >= 3600 ? (s/3600).toFixed(1)+'h' : s >= 60 ? (s/60).toFixed(0)+'m' : Math.round(s)+'s'; }
  function fmtUsd(n: number): string { return n >= 10 ? '$'+n.toFixed(0) : n >= 1 ? '$'+n.toFixed(2) : n > 0 ? '$'+n.toFixed(3) : ''; }
  function pctClass(pct: number): string { return pct >= 100 ? 'pct-100' : pct >= 90 ? 'pct-90' : pct >= 70 ? 'pct-70' : pct >= 50 ? 'pct-50' : pct > 0 ? 'pct-30' : 'pct-0'; }

  function armPct(a: ArmAgg): number { return a.total > 0 ? a.solved / a.total * 100 : -1; }

  function solveCell(a: ArmAgg, cls: string, label?: string, bStar?: boolean): string {
    if (a.total === 0) {
      if (label === 'no_driver') return `<td class="${cls} col-solve"><span class="pct-na" title="No native CPU driver for this provider">no driver</span></td>`;
      return `<td class="${cls} col-solve"><span class="pct-na">-</span></td>`;
    }
    const pct = armPct(a);
    // B* marker: generic OpenRouter kernel (no native driver) — distinguish
    // from true B (kernel-cpu). See footnote below the table.
    const star = bStar ? `<sup class="bstar" title="B*: generic OpenRouter kernel, no native driver">*</sup>` : '';
    return `<td class="${cls} col-solve"><span class="solve-pct ${pctClass(pct)}">${a.solved}/${a.total}</span>${star}</td>`;
  }

  function metricCells(a: ArmAgg, cls: string): string {
    if (a.total === 0) return `<td class="${cls}"><span class="dim">-</span></td><td class="${cls}"><span class="dim">-</span></td><td class="${cls} last"><span class="dim">-</span></td>`;
    const cost = fmtUsd(a.cost);
    const tok = a.tokens > 0 ? fmtN(a.tokens) : '-';
    const turns = a.turns > 0 ? String(a.turns) : '-';
    return `<td class="${cls}">${cost || '<span class="dim">-</span>'}</td><td class="${cls}">${tok}</td><td class="${cls} last">${turns}</td>`;
  }

  async function init() {
    const resp = await fetch('/board-v760.json');
    const data = await resp.json();
    const rows: any[] = data.models;

    const N = data.published_tasks || 38;
    function fmtTok(n: number): string { return n >= 1e6 ? (n/1e6).toFixed(2)+'M' : n >= 1e3 ? (n/1e3).toFixed(0)+'k' : String(n); }
    function usd(n: number): string { return n >= 10 ? '$'+n.toFixed(0) : n >= 1 ? '$'+n.toFixed(2) : '$'+n.toFixed(3); }
    function delta(d: number | null): string {
      if (d == null) return '<span class="dim">—</span>';
      if (d < 0) return `<span style="color:#3fb950;font-weight:700">${d}%</span>`;
      if (d > 0) return `<span style="color:#f85149;font-weight:700">+${d}%</span>`;
      return '<span class="dim">0%</span>';
    }
    function solveCell(solved: number | null, present: boolean, star: string): string {
      if (!present || solved == null) return '<span class="dim" title="no provider API key — native not run for this model">no native key</span>';
      return `<span class="solve-pct ${pctClass(solved / N * 100)}">${solved}/${N}</span>${star}`;
    }
    function costCell(b: any): string { return b ? usd(b.cost) : '<span class="dim" title="native CLI does not report cost">n/r</span>'; }
    function tokCell(b: any): string {
      if (!b) return '<span class="dim" title="native CLI does not report token usage">n/r</span>';
      return `<div>${fmtTok(b.billed)} <span class="dim" style="font-size:0.85em">billed</span></div>`
        + `<div style="font-size:0.58rem;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:1px">fresh ${fmtTok(b.fresh)} · read ${fmtTok(b.cache_read)} · create ${fmtTok(b.cache_create)}</div>`;
    }

    let sortKey = 'kernel_solved';
    let sortDir = -1;
    const sval = (r: any) => {
      const K = r.kernel ?? r.kernel_abs;
      switch (sortKey) {
        case 'model': case 'type': return r[sortKey];
        case 'native_solved': return r.native_solved ?? -1;
        case 'kernel_solved': return r.kernel_solved ?? -1;
        case 'native_cost': return r.native?.cost ?? -1;
        case 'native_tok': return r.native?.billed ?? -1;
        case 'kernel_cost': return K?.cost ?? -1;
        case 'kernel_tok': return K?.billed ?? -1;
        case 'cost_delta': return r.cost_delta ?? 999;
        case 'tok_delta': return r.tok_delta ?? 999;
        default: return r.kernel_solved ?? -1;
      }
    };
    const sort = () => rows.sort((a: any, b: any) => {
      const av = sval(a), bv = sval(b);
      if (av === bv) return 0;
      return sortDir * (typeof av === 'string' ? av.localeCompare(bv) : av - bv);
    });

    const render = () => {
      sort();
      document.getElementById('lb-body')!.innerHTML = rows.map((r: any) => {
        const star = r.type === 'B*' ? '<sup class="bstar" title="generic OpenRouter kernel, no native driver">*</sup>' : '';
        const K = r.kernel ?? r.kernel_abs;
        const natB = r.cost_trusted ? r.native : null;
        return `<tr>
          <td><span class="model-name">${r.model}</span> <span class="dim" style="font-size:0.6rem">${r.native_cli}</span></td>
          <td>${r.type}</td>
          <td class="arm-native col-solve">${solveCell(r.native_solved, r.native_present, '')}</td>
          <td class="arm-cpu col-solve">${solveCell(r.kernel_solved, true, star)}</td>
          <td class="arm-native">${costCell(natB)}</td>
          <td class="arm-native">${tokCell(natB)}</td>
          <td class="arm-cpu">${costCell(K)}</td>
          <td class="arm-cpu">${tokCell(K)}</td>
          <td>${delta(r.cost_delta)}</td>
          <td>${delta(r.tok_delta)}</td>
        </tr>`;
      }).join('');
      document.querySelectorAll('#lb-head th').forEach(th => {
        th.classList.toggle('sorted', (th as HTMLElement).dataset.key === sortKey);
      });
    };

    document.querySelectorAll('#lb-head th').forEach(th => {
      th.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const key = (th as HTMLElement).dataset.key;
        if (!key) return;
        if (sortKey === key) sortDir *= -1;
        else { sortKey = key; sortDir = (key === 'model' || key === 'type') ? 1 : -1; }
        render();
      });
    });
    render();

    const tEl = document.getElementById('totals');
    if (tEl) tEl.textContent = `${rows.length} models · ${N} benchmarks · single-shot · per-arm token buckets (fresh / cache-read / cache-create / billed) · v7.6.0`;
  }

  init();
</script>

<script>
  // ============ PER-CELL MATRIX (heatmap + mobile accordion) ============
  (async function () {
    const resp = await fetch('/cells-v760.json');
    if (!resp || !resp.ok) return;
    const data = await resp.json();
    const benches: any[] = data.benchmarks;
    const models: any[] = data.models;

    const short = (m: string) => m
      .replace('claude-', '').replace('-preview', '')
      .replace('-pro', '').replace('gemini-3.1', 'gemini-3.1');
    const ftok = (n: number) => n >= 1e6 ? (n / 1e6).toFixed(2) + 'M' : n >= 1e3 ? (n / 1e3).toFixed(0) + 'k' : String(n);
    const usd = (n: number | null) => n == null ? '—' : n >= 10 ? '$' + n.toFixed(0) : n >= 1 ? '$' + n.toFixed(2) : '$' + n.toFixed(3);
    const stCls = (s: string) => 'st-' + s;
    const stLabel: Record<string, string> = { pass: 'solved', fail: 'failed', deadline: 'timed out', infra: 'harness limit', missing: 'not run' };

    // ---- desktop matrix ----
    function renderMatrix() {
      // tier bands (group consecutive same-tier benches)
      let bands = '';
      let i = 0;
      while (i < benches.length) {
        const t = benches[i].tier; let j = i;
        while (j < benches.length && benches[j].tier === t) j++;
        bands += `<th class="tier-band ${t}" colspan="${j - i}">${t}</th>`;
        i = j;
      }
      const heads = benches.map(b =>
        `<th class="bench-h"><div title="${b.name} — solved by ${b.solved}/${b.total} arms">${b.name} <span class="bh-pct">${b.solve_pct}%</span></div></th>`
      ).join('');
      const body = models.map(m => {
        const cells = benches.map(b => {
          const c = m.cells[b.name];
          const ns = c?.native?.status || 'missing', ks = c?.kernel?.status || 'missing';
          return `<td class="hm-cell"><span class="hm-split" data-model="${m.model}" data-bench="${b.name}">`
            + `<i class="${stCls(ns)}"></i><i class="${stCls(ks)}"></i></span></td>`;
        }).join('');
        return `<tr><th class="model-h"><span class="mn">${short(m.model)}</span><span class="mt">${m.type}</span>`
          + `<span class="ms">${m.native_solved}/${benches.length} · ${m.kernel_solved}/${benches.length}</span></th>${cells}</tr>`;
      }).join('');
      return `<table class="hm-table"><thead>`
        + `<tr><th class="corner" rowspan="2"><span class="mn" style="font-size:0.6rem">model<br>nat·ker</span></th>${bands}</tr>`
        + `<tr>${heads}</tr></thead><tbody>${body}</tbody></table>`;
    }

    // ---- mobile accordion ----
    function renderMobile() {
      return models.map((m, idx) => {
        let rows = '', lastTier = '';
        for (const b of benches) {
          if (b.tier !== lastTier) { rows += `<div class="mm-tier ${b.tier}">${b.tier}</div>`; lastTier = b.tier; }
          const c = m.cells[b.name];
          const ns = c?.native?.status || 'missing', ks = c?.kernel?.status || 'missing';
          rows += `<div class="mm-row" data-model="${m.model}" data-bench="${b.name}">`
            + `<span class="bn">${b.name}</span>`
            + `<span class="hm-split" style="width:18px;height:18px"><i class="${stCls(ns)}"></i><i class="${stCls(ks)}"></i></span></div>`;
        }
        return `<div class="mm-model" data-idx="${idx}"><div class="mm-head">`
          + `<span class="mn">${short(m.model)}</span><span class="mt">${m.type}</span>`
          + `<span class="mm-solve">${m.native_solved}·${m.kernel_solved}/${benches.length}</span>`
          + `<span class="car">▸</span></div><div class="mm-body">${rows}</div></div>`;
      }).join('');
    }

    function armBlock(label: string, cls: string, c: any) {
      if (!c || c.status === 'missing') return `<div class="cd-arm ${cls}"><div class="cd-h">${label}</div><div class="cd-st dim">not run</div></div>`;
      const split = (c.input_total > 0)
        ? `<div class="cd-row"><span>fresh</span><b>${ftok(c.fresh)}</b></div>`
          + `<div class="cd-row"><span>cache read</span><b>${ftok(c.cache_read)}</b></div>`
          + `<div class="cd-row"><span>cache create</span><b>${ftok(c.cache_create)}</b></div>`
        : `<div class="cd-row"><span class="dim">input split not captured</span></div>`;
      return `<div class="cd-arm ${cls}"><div class="cd-h">${label}</div>`
        + `<div class="cd-st st-${c.status}-t">${stLabel[c.status] || c.status} · ${c.turns}t · ${Math.round(c.wall)}s</div>`
        + `<div class="cd-row"><span>billed</span><b>${ftok(c.billed)}</b></div>`
        + split
        + `<div class="cd-row"><span>output</span><b>${ftok(c.output)}</b></div>`
        + `<div class="cd-row"><span>cost</span><b>${usd(c.cost)}</b></div></div>`;
    }

    function showDetail(model: string, benchName: string) {
      const m = models.find(x => x.model === model);
      const b = benches.find((x: any) => x.name === benchName);
      const c = m?.cells[benchName];
      if (!c) return;
      const n = c.native, k = c.kernel;
      let delta = '';
      if (n && k && n.input_total > 0 && k.input_total > 0) {
        const td = (k.billed - n.billed) / n.billed * 100;
        const tc = (n.cost && k.cost != null) ? (k.cost - n.cost) / n.cost * 100 : null;
        const dc = (v: number) => `<b class="${v < 0 ? 'neg' : 'pos'}">${v > 0 ? '+' : ''}${v.toFixed(0)}%</b>`;
        delta = `<div class="cd-delta">kernel vs native &nbsp; tokens ${dc(td)}`
          + (tc != null ? ` &nbsp;·&nbsp; cost ${dc(tc)}` : '') + `</div>`;
      }
      const el = document.getElementById('cell-detail')!;
      el.innerHTML = `<span class="cd-close" id="cd-x">✕</span>`
        + `<h4>${benchName}</h4>`
        + `<div class="cd-sub">${b.tier} · solved by ${b.solved}/${b.total} arms across all models · ${short(model)}</div>`
        + `<div class="cd-arms">${armBlock('native (' + m.native_cli + ')', 'native', n)}${armBlock('kernel', 'kernel', k)}</div>${delta}`;
      el.hidden = false;
      document.getElementById('cd-x')!.addEventListener('click', () => { el.hidden = true; });
      el.scrollIntoView({ block: 'nearest', behavior: 'smooth' });
    }

    document.getElementById('matrix-wrap')!.innerHTML = renderMatrix();
    document.getElementById('matrix-mobile')!.innerHTML = renderMobile();

    // event delegation: cell/row click → detail
    function wireClicks(root: HTMLElement) {
      root.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
        const t = (e.target as HTMLElement).closest('[data-model][data-bench]') as HTMLElement | null;
        if (t) { showDetail(t.dataset.model!, t.dataset.bench!); return; }
        const head = (e.target as HTMLElement).closest('.mm-head') as HTMLElement | null;
        if (head) { head.parentElement!.classList.toggle('open'); }
      });
    }
    wireClicks(document.getElementById('matrix-wrap')!);
    wireClicks(document.getElementById('matrix-mobile')!);
  })();
</script>
